<mxCell id="leg" value="CORRECTIONS / OPEN ITEMS" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="640" width="760" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legt" value="
  • delta_roll = -10.5 mm (rod mount 10.5 ABOVE roll hinge), NOT +14.5. Cross-check: H_B derives to 157.6 ≈ your 157.5.
  • a = 67.5 mm (was 78) — confirm it is the fore/aft gap pitch-hinge→lever.
  • delta_pitch = 14.5 mm (tibia) does NOT enter the rod FK as coded.
  • rod lengths L_A=250.0905, L_B=175.1292 mm = CALCULATED from geometry (round-trip to H_A=232.5/H_B=157.5 exact).
  • CONFIRM: cranks sweep the FRONTAL (y-z) plane, A→+y, B→-y; motors on centerline, A above B by 75." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="74" y="662" width="752" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
